 ony Award winner Sergio Trujillo&rsquo\;s &ldquo\;damn-near-perfect reinve
 ntion&rdquo\; (<em>The Washington Post</em>) of <em>Damn Yankees</em>. Nam
 ed one of the Best of the Year by <em>The Washington Post</em>\, this Amer
 ican favorite is back home for the first time in 30 years. But never like 
 this.<br /><br />What if you could have it all? Youth. Talent. Glory. For 
 one average Joe\, the chance to become baseball&rsquo\;s hottest new star 
 is suddenly within reach. But when a deal too good to be true collides wit
 h a temptation he never saw coming\, the life of his dreams could cost him
  everything he truly loves.<br /><br />Irresistible music. Breathtaking da
 nce. The white-hot thrill of the game. Give in to the spectacular rush of 
 <em>Damn Yankees</em>.<br /><br />Just remember&hellip\; to keep your soul
 \, you gotta have heart.</p>
LOCATION:Marquis Theatre\, 210 West 46 Street\, New York NY 10036
END:VEVENT
